Oracle hooks for the Master System, Game Gear and SG-1000 cores: a hook
struct (every hook null unless the harness sets it), CPU boundary and
interrupt hooks, port and memory write hooks, the VDP frame and drawn-line
hooks, ROM offset queries on the cartridge boards, and access to the
private state the harness reads.

